### =====================================================================
### Path Finder API - manual test
### Butuh extension VS Code "REST Client" (humao.rest-client).
### Klik "Send Request" di atas tiap request. Jalankan berurutan dari atas.
### =====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@password = password123

### 0. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### =====================================================================
### 1. REGISTER (role: admin | mitra | perusahaan | mahasiswa, default mahasiswa)
### =====================================================================

### Register admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin Satu",
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "confirm_password": "{{password}}",
  "role": "admin"
}

### Register mitra
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PT Mitra Jaya",
  "email": "mitra@test.com",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "confirm_password": "{{password}}",
  "role": "mitra"
}

### Register mahasiswa
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi Mahasiswa",
  "email": "mhs@test.com",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "confirm_password": "{{password}}"
}

### [Negatif] Register email duplikat -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi Lagi",
  "email": "mhs@test.com",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "confirm_password": "{{password}}"
}

### [Negatif] Konfirmasi password beda -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Salah Pass",
  "email": "salah@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "confirm_password": "beda12345"
}

### =====================================================================
### 2. LOGIN (token disimpan otomatis lewat @name)
### =====================================================================

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@test.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
# @name loginMitra
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "mitra@test.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
# @name loginMhs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "mhs@test.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

### [Negatif] Password salah -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "mhs@test.com", "password": "salahbanget" }

###
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}
@mitraToken = {{loginMitra.response.body.data.token}}
@mhsToken = {{loginMhs.response.body.data.token}}

### =====================================================================
### 3. USER LOGIN (semua role)
### =====================================================================

### Profil user yang login
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}

### [Negatif] Tanpa token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### =====================================================================
### 4. FORGOT PASSWORD
### mail.host di config.json kosong, jadi OTP hanya dicetak di log server
### ("[MAIL SIMULATOR]"), bukan dikirim ke email.
### =====================================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "mhs@test.com" }

### [Negatif] Email tidak terdaftar -> 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "tidakada@test.com" }

### =====================================================================
### 5. ROLE: MAHASISWA
### =====================================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mahasiswa/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/mahasiswa/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foto_profile": "https://example.com/foto.png",
  "cv": "https://example.com/cv.pdf",
  "link_portofolio": "https://github.com/budi"
}

### [Negatif] Mahasiswa akses dashboard admin -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}

### =====================================================================
### 6. ROLE: MITRA / PERUSAHAAN
### =====================================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mitra/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{mitraToken}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/perusahaan/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{mitraToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama_perusahaan": "PT Mitra Jaya Abadi",
  "lokasi": "Malang",
  "foto_profile": "https://example.com/logo.png"
}

### =====================================================================
### 7. ROLE: ADMIN - CRUD mahasiswa
### =====================================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Tambah mahasiswa (password default = NIM)
# @name createMhs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/mahasiswa
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Siti Aminah",
  "email": "siti@test.com",
  "nim": "2241720001"
}

###
@mhsId = {{createMhs.response.body.data.id}}

### List + paging + search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/mahasiswa?page=1&size=10&search=siti
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/mahasiswa/{{mhsId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Update
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/mahasiswa/{{mhsId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Siti Aminah Updated", "portfolio_url": "https://siti.dev" }

### Mahasiswa baru bisa login pakai NIM sebagai password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "siti@test.com", "password": "2241720001" }

### [Negatif] NIM duplikat -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/mahasiswa
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Duplikat", "email": "dup@test.com", "nim": "2241720001" }

### Hapus
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/mahasiswa/{{mhsId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [Negatif] Detail setelah dihapus -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/mahasiswa/{{mhsId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### =====================================================================
### 6. CERITA DIRI (STORY)
### =====================================================================

### Kirim cerita diri (minimal 50 karakter, maksimal 2000) -> 201
# @name createStory
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stories
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Saya adalah mahasiswa yang senang membangun aplikasi mobile. Saya pernah mengerjakan proyek katalog produk dan aplikasi pencatatan keuangan sederhana menggunakan Flutter."
}

### Ambil cerita terakhir milik sendiri
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stories/me
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}

### [Negatif] Cerita terlalu pendek -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stories
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "terlalu pendek" }

### [Negatif] Tanpa token -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Saya adalah mahasiswa yang senang membangun aplikasi mobile dan belajar hal baru setiap hari." }

